+# Tool Input Validation
+
+| Field  | Value                |
+| ------ | -------------------- |
+| Issue  | re-cinq/HALEngine#37 |
+| Status | Draft                |
+
+Tool calls are checked against the schema declared by the resolved tool before the executor can act on model-provided input.
+
+## Validation
+
+- A schema-invalid tool input returns a `ToolResponse` describing the failed constraint and does not invoke the executor. ([validated by: rejects required, type and enum violations before execution](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L11))
+- A wrong-typed value is rejected with its property path and expected type, without exposing the submitted value. ([validated by: rejects required, type and enum violations before execution](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L11))
+- A value outside a declared enum is rejected with its property path and without exposing the submitted value. ([validated by: rejects required, type and enum violations before execution](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L11))
+- Schema-valid input, including undeclared properties, reaches the executor unchanged and exactly once. ([validated by: passes valid input with extra properties through unchanged](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L41))
+- An invalid static schema fails registration with the tool name, and a function-valued definition is validated against the schema it resolves for each call. ([validated by: fails invalid static schemas at registration and uses each resolved dynamic schema](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L58))
